66	/// `dashboard.aggregate.get`'s own response `data` (`openapi.yaml:1582-
67	/// 1688`) — decodes every field the contract declares (Code Map: "mirrors
68	/// the full contract... same precedent as `ExportJobStatusDto`"), even
